    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc14 COTS </strong>is first and foremost a <strong>game about strategy</strong>. It\u2019s a <strong>fun tower defense</strong> game where <strong>chickens </strong>are the <strong>protagonists of their story</strong>, and get to <strong>fight for their territory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687890/extras/64318a148800d8eb9412c2b87fa06a97.avif?t=1747212642\" data-has-big width=800 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Well, we say, chickens, but the characters in this game are <strong>Cots <i>- chickens but better</i></strong><i> -</i> with super unique abilities. Each Cot has a specific role and its <strong>assigned skills</strong>: one is a builder, the other a fighter, sniper, etc. With the <strong>eggs </strong>they lay as <strong>currency</strong>, buy <strong>buffs </strong>to boost your cots, or <strong>items </strong>to <strong>trap </strong>and attack <strong>enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a The <strong>goal</strong>? <strong>Survive </strong>for as many nights as possible as waves and <strong>waves of predators invade your coop!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc14 COTS </strong>is first and foremost a <strong>game about strategy</strong>. It\u2019s a <strong>fun tower defense</strong> game where <strong>chickens </strong>are the <strong>protagonists of their story</strong>, and get to <strong>fight for their territory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687890/extras/64318a148800d8eb9412c2b87fa06a97.avif?t=1747212642\" data-has-big width=800 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Well, we say, chickens, but the characters in this game are <strong>Cots <i>- chickens but better</i></strong><i> -</i> with super unique abilities. Each Cot has a specific role and its <strong>assigned skills</strong>: one is a builder, the other a fighter, sniper, etc. With the <strong>eggs </strong>they lay as <strong>currency</strong>, buy <strong>buffs </strong>to boost your cots, or <strong>items </strong>to <strong>trap </strong>and attack <strong>enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a The <strong>goal</strong>? <strong>Survive </strong>for as many nights as possible as waves and <strong>waves of predators invade your coop!</strong></p>",
